  "weekly_summary": {
    "items": [
      {
        "deck_links": [],
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "en": "The Standard metagame went through two changes this week: first, last week’s major bans (Badgermole Cub, Stormchaser’s Talent, and Gran-Gran); then HOB entered the format this week. HOB’s immediate impact has been relatively small, however, and the bans have been the much bigger factor.",
          "zh": "本周标准环境经历了两个变化：首先是上周的大禁牌（獾、蓝才能、奶奶）；然后HOB本周也进入了环境。不过相比之下HOB对环境的影响还是比较小的，主要还是禁牌的效果。"
        }
      },
      {
        "deck_links": [],
        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "en": "The most obvious result is that the Prowess deck that still dominated the format last week disappeared completely, while the Fling deck that shares some of its components was reduced to a single Top 8. Without the Stormchaser’s Talent and Boomerang Basics package—the strategy’s strongest interaction—decks built along similar lines have fallen off sharply.",
          "zh": "最显而易见的是上周还持续占据环境霸主地位的灵技套牌直接原地消失，组件一部分类似的投掷套牌也只剩一套。缺少了蓝才能飞去来这个最强配合之后类似思路的套牌强度确实是一落千丈。"
        }
      },
      {
        "deck_links": [
          {
            "deck": {
              "archetype_id": "jeskai-lessons",
              "deck_fingerprint_sha256": "c7bb6e2da7ce6ec00a7d84a60394078bf0945af07cd1c1d6e1758f05741852f1",
              "deck_id": "0ef7de8666929e404c95",
              "display_name": "Jeskai Lessons",
              "event_id": "12851664",
              "final_rank": 1,
              "player": "J_tekt",
              "starttime": "2026-08-15 13:00:00.0"
            },
            "label": {
              "en": "Jeskai Lessons · J_tekt · Rank 1",
              "zh": "Jeskai Lessons · J_tekt · 第1名"
            },
            "order": 1,
            "token": "deck:0ef7de8666929e404c95"
          }
        ],
        "order": 3,
        "text": {
          "en": "Jeskai Lessons survived the Gran-Gran ban and even won two events. deck:0ef7de8666929e404c95 The archetype was never completely dependent on Gran-Gran to begin with, but both winning lists played Artist’s Talent. The cost reduction from its second chapter helps make up for some of the explosiveness lost with Gran-Gran.",
          "zh": "石板课在禁了奶奶之后，还以洁斯凯形态存在，并可以席卷两场。deck:0ef7de8666929e404c95 本来这个构筑其实就并不完全依赖奶奶，不过两场席卷的构筑都带了艺术家才能，第2章的减费效果一定程度上可以弥补失去奶奶之后的爆发力不足问题。"
        }
      },
      {
        "deck_links": [
          {
            "deck": {
              "archetype_id": "mono-green-landfall",
              "deck_fingerprint_sha256": "2b6e0f496ecc27ff6352455088cff9fae95a24f568d921d350d24d9ef7d19fc6",
              "deck_id": "113f08b5c4dcc7b5e1ce",
              "display_name": "Mono-Green Landfall",
              "event_id": "12851611",
              "final_rank": 1,
              "player": "Brasatore",
              "starttime": "2026-08-11 19:00:00.0"
            },
            "label": {
              "en": "Mono-Green Landfall · Brasatore · Rank 1",
              "zh": "Mono-Green Landfall · Brasatore · 第1名"
            },
            "order": 1,
            "token": "deck:113f08b5c4dcc7b5e1ce"
          },
          {
            "deck": {
              "archetype_id": "mono-green-landfall",
              "deck_fingerprint_sha256": "79244fc5ca9f7e56249da1a60ad9b7b4c1ef91ec29df042442de22c07d826157",
              "deck_id": "3b20a57979ef845780d2",
              "display_name": "Mono-Green Landfall",
              "event_id": "12851684",
              "final_rank": 1,
              "player": "Scorpion100",
              "starttime": "2026-08-16 21:00:00.0"
            },
            "label": {
              "en": "Mono-Green Landfall · Scorpion100 · Rank 1",
              "zh": "Mono-Green Landfall · Scorpion100 · 第1名"
            },
            "order": 2,
            "token": "deck:3b20a57979ef845780d2"
          }
        ],
        "order": 4,
        "text": {
          "en": "The early winners of the first post-ban week are Mono-Green Landfall and Dimir Midrange. They are tied for first in high-score share and also rank first and second in Top 8 share. Landfall has not settled on a replacement for Badgermole Cub, and in practice those four slots do not appear to matter very much to the deck’s overall strength. One winning list used Mole Man, Moloid Master and Bristly Bill, Spine Sower: deck:113f08b5c4dcc7b5e1ce; the other used the two-mana ramp spell Shared Roots alongside Keen-Eyed Curator: deck:3b20a57979ef845780d2",
          "zh": "而禁牌后第一周的最大赢家暂时是纯绿地落和蓝黑中速，并列高胜占比第一，而且八强占比也分列前二。地落用什么填补獾的位置暂时还没有定论，这四个位置其实对套牌强度的影响不算太大。席卷的版本一个是用了鼹鼠人和比利：deck:113f08b5c4dcc7b5e1ce；另一套2费Ramp同根共生和小浣熊锐目鉴物客：deck:3b20a57979ef845780d2"
        }
      },
      {
        "deck_links": [
          {
            "deck": {
              "archetype_id": "dimir-midrange",
              "deck_fingerprint_sha256": "f1b0b3ae076fd8366de39836447465389fd902c49f776c77673955621d12ab1c",
              "deck_id": "6552a16bef7fa5293b5d",
              "display_name": "Dimir Midrange",
