          }
        ],
        "order": 6,
        "text": {
          "en": "Orzhov Lifegain has also remained fairly resilient. It won one event this week, but with a build that differs from previous versions by playing a full set of Raise the Past: deck:085fbae05701d25afeda",
          "zh": "黑白回血近期也还算比较坚挺，本周席卷一场，不过是和之前构筑不太一样的满编召起过往的版本：deck:085fbae05701d25afeda"
        }
