        "order": 9,
        "text": {
          "en": "A Grixis Tablet control shell reached the Top 8 for the first time: deck:96b30d5e076425e95de6. This was not a new piece of HOB technology, but a Grixis Tablet build that combines Fin Fang Foom with land destruction. The core is still Tablet Control, but instead of ramping toward a large finisher like earlier builds, this list leans more heavily on board control and attacking mana. With Fin Fang Foom in play, both Price of Freedom and Avengers Disassembled can destroy two lands outright, while a six-damage sweeper leaves the Dragon alive and adds a counter to it. Compared with Jeskai Revelation, the traditional Tablet Control finisher, however, this endgame does not look especially powerful in the current field.",
          "zh": "格利极石板控制思路首次进入八强：deck:96b30d5e076425e95de6。不是HOB的新科技，而是用非凡龙配合炸地的格利极版本石板套牌。基本思路还是石板控，不过相比以往石板控ramp出大招的思路，这套牌更偏控场和炸地。自由的代价和复仇者解散在非凡龙站场的情况下都可以直接炸两块地，同时扫场扫6非凡龙加豆还不会死。不过相比传统石板控的洁斯凯启示，这个终端在现环境下并没有特别强力。"
        }
